      "role": "user",
      "content": "200mg twice?? wow thats a lot. i don't think i have that much left tho. also my neck feels super stiff and i'm getting a bit dizzy, is that just part of the migraine or should i be worried about something else? i really just want to stay home and sleep this off if i can.",
